## One thing I want you to pay particular attention to

Your screenshot showed **5 links analyzed**, and the new UI should make that a first-class feature:

```text
Current WhatsApp
       │
       ├── Link A ──┐
       ├── Link B ──┤
       ├── Link C ──┤
       ├── Link D ──┤
       └── Link E ──┘
                    ↓
          Security Center
                    ↓
          Link Analysis
                    ↓
          A  B  C  D  E
```

So we're **not** going to create five floating VerifyFirst overlays. The overlay remains the immediate warning mechanism, while the full-page Security Center is where the user can inspect the complete set of analyzed security events.

